blurb: The South Portland School Board meeting featured a celebration of the boys'
  indoor track team's state championship, updates on pre-kindergarten expansion and
  diversity, equity, and inclusion initiatives. The superintendent also presented
  the proposed FY25 budget, highlighting its conservative nature amidst changing student
  demographics and the loss of federal COVID funding.
